From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:47:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Give quick access's screensaver row an icon name of its own

Quick access took the scraper's icon for its screensaver row, so a
theme with menu icons showed a magnifier there and no icon on the
other rows unless it drew one for each.

The row now asks for iconScreensaver when the theme has it, and the
scraper's icon as before when it does not. THEMES.md lists the other
icon names quick access and the quit menu ask for.
---
 THEMES.md                   | 3 ++-
 es-app/src/guis/GuiMenu.cpp | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/THEMES.md b/THEMES.md
index 936d3928..dd6241de 100644
--- a/THEMES.md
+++ b/THEMES.md
@@ -1598,7 +1598,8 @@ BATOCERA 5.24 - Add images to menuitems
 
 * `*` - type: PATH. 
   - Element name must be the image name in the list : iconSystem, iconUpdates, iconControllers, iconGames, iconUI, iconSound, iconNetwork, iconScraper, iconAdvanced, iconQuit, iconRetroachievements, iconKodi, iconRestart, iconShutdown, iconFastShutdown,
-    iconNewGame and iconAutoSave (the save states' tiles that start a new game and a new autosave)
+    iconNewGame and iconAutoSave (the save states' tiles that start a new game and a new autosave), iconScreensaver
+    (quick access's screensaver; default: iconScraper), iconManual, iconPlanemode, iconSound
 
 #### controllerActivity
 
diff --git a/es-app/src/guis/GuiMenu.cpp b/es-app/src/guis/GuiMenu.cpp
index 9d13d673..0e98ab31 100644
--- a/es-app/src/guis/GuiMenu.cpp
+++ b/es-app/src/guis/GuiMenu.cpp
@@ -4216,7 +4216,7 @@ void GuiMenu::openQuitMenu_static(Window *window, bool quickAccessMenu, bool ani
 					});
 				delete s;
 
-			}, "iconScraper", true);
+			}, ThemeData::getMenuTheme()->getMenuIcon("iconScreensaver").empty() ? "iconScraper" : "iconScreensaver", true);
 
 		if (ApiSystem::getInstance()->isScriptingSupported(ApiSystem::ScriptId::PDFEXTRACTION) && Utils::FileSystem::exists(Paths::getUserManualPath()))
 		{
